<p>Craft a hammer from the dream forge and strike an adjacent foe, inflicting <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">171%, 184%, 194%, 202%, 210%</acronym> weapon damage. If the attack hits, it will bring one random Dream Smith talent off cooldown.</p><p>At talent level 5, you'll bring a second random talent off cooldown.</p><p>The base power, Accuracy, Armour penetration, and critical strike chance of the weapon will scale with your Mindpower.</p><p></p><p>Current Dream Hammer Stats:</p><p>Base power: 16.0 - 24.0</p><p>Uses stat: 120% Wil</p><p>Damage type: <span style="color: #ffffff"><span class="tstr-color-WHITE">Physical</span></span></p><p>Mastery: <span style="color: #ffd700"><span class="tstr-color-GOLD">Dream Crusher</span></span></p><p>Accuracy is based on willpower for this weapon.</p><p>Attack speed: <span style="color: #00ff00"><span class="tstr-color-LIGHT_GREEN">100%</span></span></p><p></p>